---
---
<div class="process-wrap">
  <section class="section--all">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process-heading">
        <p class="process-sub-text reveal-element">
          The best client is a happy client
        </p>
        <h1 class="process-big-h reveal-element">
          PROCESS
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="grid-process">
          <div class="card-block-process process-1">
            <h1 class="process-num-text">
              01
            </h1>
            <h1 class="headingfig-2 reveal-element">
              01. Client Onboarding & Planning
            </h1>
            <div class="process-text">
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                We start by getting to know your goals, brand, and audience. Through consultations and questionnaires, we define the project scope, timeline, and strategy to ensure everything aligns with your vision.
              </p>
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                Includes:
              </p>
              <ul class="list reveal-element">
                <li>
                  Discovery call
                </li>
                <li>
                  Project brief
                </li>
                <li>
                  Goals & timeline
                  <div></div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Content planning
                  <div></div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-block-process process-2">
            <h1 class="process-num-text">
              02
            </h1>
            <h1 class="headingfig-2 reveal-element">
              02. Design & Development
            </h1>
            <div class="process-text-2">
              <div class="process-text">
                <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                  2a. Design Phase
                </p>
                <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                  We create the visual direction of your website, including layout, colors, typography, and user experience. You'll review and approve the design before development begins.
                </p>
                  <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                    Includes:
                  </p>
                  <ul class="list reveal-element">
                    <li>
                      Wireframes & layouts
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      Visual design concepts
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      UI/UX design
                      <div></div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      Client approval
                      <div></div>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                
              </div>
              <div class="process-text">
                <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                  2b. Development Phase
                </p>
                <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                  Once the design is approved, we move into building your website. We turn the approved designs into a fully functional, responsive site.
                </p>
                  <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                    Includes:
                  </p>
                  <ul class="list reveal-element">
                    <li>
                      Website development
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      Mobile responsiveness
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      Performance optimization
                      <div></div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      Feature integration
                      <div></div>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-block-process process-3">
            <h1 class="process-num-text">
              03
            </h1>
            <h1 class="headingfig-2 reveal-element">
              03. Feedback & Testing
            </h1>
            <div class="process-text">
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                Your input matters. We review the project together, make refinements, and thoroughly test for performance, usability, and compatibility.
              </p>
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                Includes:
              </p>
              <ul class="list reveal-element">
                <li>
                  Client review
                </li>
                <li>
                  Revisions
                </li>
                <li>
                  Speed & security testing
                  <div></div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Cross-device testing
                  <div></div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-block-process process-4">
            <h1 class="process-num-text">
              04
            </h1>
            <h1 class="headingfig-2 reveal-element">
              04. Handover & Training
            </h1>
            <div class="process-text">
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                Once everything is approved, we launch your website and ensure you’re confident managing it going forward.
              </p>
              <p class="paragraph-text reveal-element">
                Includes:
              </p>
              <ul class="list reveal-element">
                <li>
                  Final delivery
                </li>
                <li>
                  Admin access
                </li>
                <li>
                  Training session
                  <div></div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Ongoing support option
                  <div></div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Maintenance options
                  <div></div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
    /* MARGIN */

.process-wrap {
  padding-inline: 16px; /* applies below 425px */
}

/* 425px → 768px */
@media (min-width: 425px) {
  .process-wrap {
    padding-inline: clamp(16px, calc(4.66vw - 3.8px), 32px);
  }
}

/* 768px → 1272px */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .process-wrap {
    padding-inline: clamp(32px, calc(10.32vw - 47.3px), 84px);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1920px) {
  .process-wrap {
    background-image: none;
  }
}

.process-wrap {
  background-color: var(--primary-background-70op);
}

.process {
  display: flex;
  padding-top: 128px;
  padding-bottom: 128px;
  flex-flow: column;
  gap: 72px;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
  .process {
    padding-top: 72px;
    padding-bottom: 72px;
  }
}

.process-heading {
  position: static;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24px;
  border-top-style: solid;
  border-top-width: 1px;
  border-top-color: var(--secondary-text-color);
  border-bottom-style: solid;
  border-bottom-width: 1px;
  border-bottom-color: var(--secondary-text-color);
}

@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
  .process-heading {
    flex-flow: wrap;
  }
}

.process-sub-text {
  max-width: 150px;
  margin: 0px;
  color: var(--primary-text-color);
  font-size: var(--text-lg-size);
  line-height: var(--text-lg-lineheight-less);
  font-weight: var(--text-weight);
}

.process-big-h {
  margin: 0px;
  margin-bottom: 0px;
  color: var(--primary-text-color);
  font-size: var(--big-text-black-size);
  line-height: 82%;
  font-weight: var(--big-text-black-weight);
}

@media screen and (max-width: 425px) {
  .process-big-h {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }
}

.grid-process {
  display: grid;
  grid-auto-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 4px;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .grid-process {
    place-items: stretch;
    grid-auto-flow: row;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto auto;
  }
}

.card-block-process {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  padding: 84px 36px 72px;
  flex-flow: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 48px;
  border-style: solid;
  border-width: 1px;
  border-color: rgb(54, 54, 54);
  background-color: var(--secondary-background);
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}


.card-block-process:hover {
  background-color: #000;
}


@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .card-block-process {
    position: relative;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .card-block-process {
        padding: 48px 24px;
    }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
  .card-block-process {
    padding-right: 12px;
    padding-left: 12px;
  }
}


.process-1 {
  grid-area: span 1 / span 5 / span 1 / span 5;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-1 {
    grid-area: span 1 / span 12 / span 1 / span 12;
  }
}

.process-2 {
  grid-area: span 1 / span 7 / span 1 / span 7;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-2 {
    grid-area: span 1 / span 12 / span 1 / span 12;
  }
}

.process-3 {
  grid-area: span 1 / span 6 / span 1 / span 6;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-3 {
    grid-area: span 1 / span 12 / span 1 / span 12;
  }
}

.process-4 {
  grid-area: span 1 / span 6 / span 1 / span 6;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-4 {
    grid-area: span 1 / span 12 / span 1 / span 12;
  }
}


.process-num-text {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0px;
  top: -4px;
  margin-block-start: 0px;
  margin-block-end: 0px;
  z-index: auto;
  background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(53, 53, 53), rgb(20, 20, 20));
  font-size: var(--big-text-black-size);
  line-height: 80%;
  font-weight: var(--big-text-black-weight);
  background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

.headingfig-2 {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 0px;
  margin-bottom: 0px;
  font-family: Satoshi;
  color: var(--primary-text-color);
  font-size: var(--h2-medium-size);
  line-height: 20px;
  font-weight: var(--h2-medium-weight);
}

.process-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-flow: column;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24px;
}





@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-text {
    max-width: 600px;
  }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
  .process-text {
    max-width: 400px;
  }
}

.process-text-2 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24px;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .process-text-2 {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    flex-flow: wrap;
    gap: 48px;
  }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
  .process-text-2 {
    flex-flow: column;
  }
}


.paragraph-text {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0px;
  color: var(--secondary-text-color);
  font-size: var(--text-sm-size);
  line-height: var(--text-sm-lineheight);
  font-weight: var(--text-weight);
  transition: color 0.3s ease;
}


.paragraph-text:hover {
  color: var(--primary-text-color);
}






@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
  .paragraph-text {
    display: flex;
    max-width: none;
    flex-flow: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
}

.list {
  display: flex;
  font-size: var(--text-sm-size);
  margin-left: 20px;
  flex-flow: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 4px;
  color: var(--secondary-text-color);
  transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

.list:hover {
  color: var(--primary-text-color);
}





</style>